{"id":"448976","name":"西葫芦肉丝汤","author":"梦桃缘","authorId":"6591561","desc":"","cover":"images/448976/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西葫芦","amount":"1个"},{"name":"猪瘦肉","amount":"100克"},{"name":"葱","amount":"1颗"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"1大碗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"所需材料。","img":"images/448976/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将所有食材洗净切好备用。","img":"images/448976/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肉丝里加入适量盐、生抽胡椒粉和淀粉抓匀。","img":"images/448976/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"上锅入适量油加热，加入西葫芦煸炒均匀。","img":"images/448976/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量盐继续煸炒片刻。","img":"images/448976/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入一大碗的水。","img":"images/448976/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盖紧煮开。","img":"images/448976/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮约六七分钟后加入肉丝。","img":"images/448976/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖紧继续大火煮约两分钟至肉丝熟透离火。","img":"images/448976/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入葱花即可。","img":"images/448976/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品～滴入少许香油食用。","img":"images/448976/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}